{
  "$comment": "R-1462 — env var NAME → Secret Manager secret NAME (or a plain, non-secret value). Source: docs/R-909-LIVE-CUTOVER.md sections 2.1–2.3 + 3. NEVER a secret value. `{prefix}`, `{appUrl}`, `{bucket}` are filled from `envs.<env>`. Read by scripts/ops/live-env-commands.mjs and tests/ops/live-env-commands.test.ts.",
